  "id": "greek-orange-phyllo-cake",
  "name": "Greek Orange Phyllo Cake",
  "subtitle": "Crisp phyllo baked with orange, yogurt, and cinnamon syrup",
  "description": "A Greek-style dessert combining crumbled phyllo with orange, yogurt, and olive oil, finished with warm cinnamon-orange syrup.",
